{"title":"Bus stop count comparator","genre":"software","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nBuild an offline tool for a neighborhood group comparing manual bus boarding counts at Maple Corner and Library Square. Use fictional observations with columns date, stop, minutes observed, boardings, and buses: Jun 1, Maple, 30, 18, 3; Jun 1, Library, 45, 36, 4; Jun 3, Maple, 45, 24, 4; Jun 3, Library, 30, 20, 3; Jun 8, Maple, 60, 33, 6; Jun 8, Library, 30, 0, 0. All dates are in 2026. Support session entry, date filters, and comparisons of boardings per observed hour and per bus using pooled totals. Show a zero-bus session without inventing a per-bus value.","works":{"b008b9c1b79f34dd":{"files":[{"name":"index.html","bytes":12723,"sha256":"07b741d56d786e3287b77b8b986c5adc8a80af7cd8527293a00e671f844d29d4","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Stop Ledger · Boarding counts</title>\n<style>\n:root{--ink:#182e37;--muted:#526269;--paper:#f6f5ef;--line:#ccd0c7;--maple:#b45226;--library:#26756d;--card:#fffef8;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);font:16px/1.45 \"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}header{background:var(--ink);color:white}main,.bar{width:min(1140px,calc(100% - 64px));margin:auto}.bar{height:66px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.brand{font-weight:750;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.7px}.logo{background:#f2c860;border-radius:5px;width:35px;height:35px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ink)}.offline{margin-left:auto;font:12px monospace;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.offline:before{content:\"\";background:#a9ceb2;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:100%}main{padding:34px 0}.title,.sectionhead,.cardhead,.recordhead{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1.02}h2{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-1.1px}h3{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-1px}.sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}.action,button,input,select{font:inherit}button,select{cursor:pointer}button{min-height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border-radius:5px;padding:8px 15px;font-weight:600}button:hover{filter:brightness(.94)}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #387da1;outline-offset:2px}.action{background:var(--ink);color:white;border-color:var(--ink);font-weight:650}.action span{font-size:20px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:6px}.filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;gap:16px;border-block:1px solid var(--line);margin:28px 0 24px;padding:16px 0}.filters strong{align-self:center;margin-right:6px}label{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}input,select{background:var(--card);border:1px solid #aeb7b1;color:var(--ink);min-height:44px;border-radius:4px;padding:7px 10px;min-width:0}.clear{border:0;background:none;text-decoration:underline;font-size:13px}.sectionhead{margin-bottom:12px}.scope{font:12px monospace;color:var(--muted)}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.card{--accent:var(--maple);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card);padding:18px 22px 14px}.card.library{--accent:var(--library)}.cardhead{justify-content:start;gap:10px}.marker{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:white;font:bold 15px monospace}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:16px 0}.stat+.stat{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:18px}.stat b{font:500 clamp(35px,4vw,53px)/1.1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-2px;display:block}.stat small{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.totals{border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:12px;font:13px/1.6 monospace;color:var(--muted)}details{margin:12px 0 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}summary{cursor:pointer;width:fit-content;padding:6px 0}details p{max-width:80ch;margin:5px 0}.recordhead{margin-bottom:10px}.tablewrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card)}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}th,td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}th{font:600 12px/1.4 monospace;color:var(--muted);background:#eaede5}td{font-size:14px}td:nth-child(-n+2),th:nth-child(-n+2){text-align:left}tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}.stop{font-weight:600}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;background:var(--maple);margin-right:8px}.dot.library{background:var(--library)}.foot,.message{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.message:empty{display:none}dialog{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:26px;width:min(420px,94vw)}dialog::backdrop{background:#12252cc2}dialog label{margin-top:14px}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:end;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}.empty{text-align:center!important;padding:24px}.error{color:#993c24}.storage{color:#993c24}footer{margin-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}\n@media(max-width:700px){main,.bar{width:calc(100% - 32px)}main{padding-top:24px}.title{align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.filters{gap:10px}.filters strong{width:100%}.filters label{flex:1 1 130px}.sectionhead{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}.card{padding:16px}.stat b{font-size:40px}.stats{margin:12px 0}th,td{padding:10px}.offline{font-size:11px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><div class=\"bar\"><span class=\"logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M4 12h16M12 4v8M7 19v3m10-3v3M7 16h2m6 0h2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brand\">Stop Ledger</span><span class=\"offline\">Offline workspace</span></div></header>\n<main>\n<div class=\"title\"><div><h1>Boarding counts</h1><p class=\"sub\">Manual observations at Maple Corner and Library Square.</p></div><button class=\"action\" id=\"add\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span>Add session</button></div>\n<div class=\"filters\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Inclusive date range\"><strong>Date range</strong><label>From<input id=\"from\" type=\"date\"></label><label>Through<input id=\"through\" type=\"date\"></label><button class=\"clear\" id=\"clear\">Clear dates</button></div>\n<p id=\"warning\" class=\"error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n<section><div class=\"sectionhead\"><h2>Stop comparison</h2><span id=\"scope\" class=\"scope\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><div id=\"cards\" class=\"cards\"></div>\n<details><summary>How the rates are calculated</summary><p>For each stop, add up the boardings, minutes and buses in the selected dates. Divide total boardings by total observed hours for the hourly rate, or by total buses for the per-bus rate. Every observed minute counts, including time spent waiting when no buses arrive. A dash means the rate has no denominator.</p></details></section>\n<section><div class=\"recordhead\"><h2>Session log</h2></div><div class=\"tablewrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Observation sessions\"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Stop</th><th>Minutes observed</th><th>Boardings</th><th>Buses</th><th>Boardings / bus</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"log\"></tbody></table></div><p class=\"foot\">— &nbsp;No buses observed. The per-bus rate is undefined.</p></section>\n<p id=\"status\" class=\"message\" role=\"status\"></p><p id=\"storage\" class=\"storage\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n<footer>The six starting sessions are fictional. Added sessions are stored in this browser.</footer>\n</main>\n<dialog id=\"entry\" aria-labelledby=\"entrytitle\"><form id=\"form\"><h2 id=\"entrytitle\">Add session</h2><label>Date<input name=\"date\" type=\"date\" required min=\"0001-01-01\" max=\"9999-12-31\"></label><label>Stop<select name=\"stop\"><option>Maple Corner</option><option>Library Square</option></select></label><label>Minutes observed<input name=\"minutes\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" required></label><label>Boardings<input name=\"boardings\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" required></label><label>Buses<input name=\"buses\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" required></label><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"cancel\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"action\">Save session</button></div></form></dialog>\n<script>\n'use strict';\nconst stops = ['Maple Corner','Library Square'];\nconst seed = [\n  ['2026-06-01',0,30,18,3], ['2026-06-01',1,45,36,4],\n  ['2026-06-03',0,45,24,4], ['2026-06-03',1,30,20,3],\n  ['2026-06-08',0,60,33,6], ['2026-06-08',1,30,0,0]\n].map(([date,stop,minutes,boardings,buses]) => ({date,stop:stops[stop],minutes,boardings,buses}));\nconst byId = id => document.getElementById(id);\nconst prefix = 'stop-ledger.session.v1.';\nconst additions = new Map();\nfunction valid(s) {\n  if (!s || !/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(s.date) || !stops.includes(s.stop)) return false;\n  const day = new Date(s.date+'T00:00:00Z');\n  return Number.isFinite(+day) && day.toISOString().slice(0,10) === s.date &&\n    [s.minutes,s.boardings,s.buses].every(n => Number.isSafeInteger(n) && n >= 0) &&\n    s.minutes > 0 && (s.buses > 0 || s.boardings === 0);\n}\nfunction readSaved() {\n  try {\n    for (const key of Object.keys(localStorage).filter(k => k.startsWith(prefix))) {\n      try {\n        const s = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key));\n        if (!valid(s)) throw Error();\n        additions.set(key,s);\n      } catch { byId('storage').textContent = 'A saved session could not be read.'; }\n    }\n  } catch { byId('storage').textContent = 'Browser storage is unavailable. Entries last only while this page is open.'; }\n}\nconst rate = (n,d) => d ? (n/d).toFixed(1) : '—';\nconst dateFormat = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US',{month:'short',day:'numeric',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'});\nfunction render() {\n  const from = byId('from').value, end = byId('through').value;\n  const reversed = from && end && from > end;\n  byId('warning').textContent = reversed ? 'Choose an end date on or after the start date.' : '';\n  const rows = [...seed,...additions.values()].filter(s => (!from || s.date >= from) && (!end || s.date <= end))\n    .sort((a,b) => b.date.localeCompare(a.date) || stops.indexOf(a.stop)-stops.indexOf(b.stop));\n  byId('scope').textContent = (from || end ? 'Filtered dates' : 'All dates')+' · '+rows.length+' session'+(rows.length === 1 ? '' : 's');\n  byId('cards').innerHTML = stops.map((stop,i) => {\n    const group = rows.filter(s => s.stop === stop);\n    const sum = key => group.reduce((a,s) => a+s[key],0);\n    const m=sum('minutes'), b=sum('boardings'), v=sum('buses');\n    return '<article class=\"card '+(i?'library':'')+'\"><div class=\"cardhead\"><span class=\"marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">'+stop[0]+'</span><h3>'+stop+'</h3></div><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"stat\"><b>'+rate(b*60,m)+'</b><small>Boardings / observed hour</small></div><div class=\"stat\"><b>'+rate(b,v)+'</b><small>Boardings / bus</small></div></div><div class=\"totals\">'+(group.length ? b+' boardings · '+m+' min · '+v+' buses' : 'No sessions in range')+'</div></article>';\n  }).join('');\n  byId('log').innerHTML = rows.map(s => '<tr><td>'+dateFormat.format(new Date(s.date+'T00:00:00Z'))+'</td><td class=\"stop\"><span class=\"dot '+(s.stop===stops[1]?'library':'')+'\"></span>'+s.stop+'</td><td>'+s.minutes+'</td><td>'+s.boardings+'</td><td>'+s.buses+'</td><td>'+rate(s.boardings,s.buses)+'</td></tr>').join('') || '<tr><td class=\"empty\" colspan=\"6\">No sessions in this date range.</td></tr>';\n}\nfunction refreshFilters(){byId('status').textContent=''; render();}\nfor(const id of ['from','through']) byId(id).oninput = refreshFilters;\nbyId('clear').onclick = () => {byId('from').value=byId('through').value=''; refreshFilters();};\nconst form = byId('form'), fields = form.elements, entry = byId('entry');\nbyId('add').onclick = () => {\n  form.reset();\n  const now = new Date();\n  fields.date.value = new Date(+now-now.getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,10);\n  fields.buses.setCustomValidity('');\n  entry.showModal();\n};\nbyId('cancel').onclick = () => entry.close();\nform.oninput = () => fields.buses.setCustomValidity('');\nform.onsubmit = event => {\n  event.preventDefault();\n  const s = {date:fields.date.value, stop:fields.stop.value};\n  for(const key of ['minutes','boardings','buses']) {\n    s[key]=Number(fields[key].value);\n    if(!Number.isSafeInteger(s[key])) {\n      fields[key].setCustomValidity('Enter a whole number within the supported range.');\n      fields[key].reportValidity();\n      fields[key].setCustomValidity('');\n      return;\n    }\n  }\n  if(!valid(s)){\n    fields.buses.setCustomValidity('Enter at least one bus when boardings are recorded.');\n    fields.buses.reportValidity(); return;\n  }\n  const key = prefix+Date.now()+'-'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2);\n  additions.set(key,s);\n  let message = 'Session saved.';\n  try {localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(s));}\n  catch {message = 'Session added for this visit only. Browser storage is unavailable.';}\n  if ((byId('from').value && s.date < byId('from').value) || (byId('through').value && s.date > byId('through').value))\n    message += ' Clear the date range to see this session.';\n  entry.close(); render(); byId('status').textContent=message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('storage',() => {readSaved(); render();});\nreadSaved(); render();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/53355cdb52712c6927cb52b482a9446b818e9df196edbd5c465ae55050a02b2d.zip"},"75863aca7c8a26d4":{"files":[{"name":"README.md","bytes":1480,"sha256":"a7daae3907d0893ef84067cdcf058afae4819a9acef739e52d1ce2ff14e9da05","kind":"text","body":"# Bus Stop Counts\n\nOpen `index.html` in a browser. The file is self-contained and works offline with JavaScript enabled.\n\n- Use **From** and **Through** to filter the comparison and the observation log. Both dates are inclusive. Leave either date empty for an open-ended range.\n- The six fictional sessions are labeled **Sample**. Uncheck **Include fictional samples** to see just your own observations.\n- Add each observation period as a separate session, even when several sessions occur at the same stop on the same date. Enter zero boardings and zero buses when no bus came. Use **Edit** in the log to correct a manually entered session.\n- Entries are stored in the current browser when local file storage is available. Keep opening the same file in the same browser profile. **Export visible CSV** downloads the currently displayed rows. Clear both dates and turn off the samples to export all manual entries.\n\nFor each stop, the tool adds the minutes, boardings, and buses in the current view. Boardings per observed hour divides total boardings by the total minutes divided by 60. Boardings per bus divides total boardings by the total number of buses. A zero-bus session contributes its time and has no per-bus rate.\n\nWith all six fictional sessions visible, Maple Corner has 75 boardings, 135 minutes, and 13 buses (33.33 boardings per observed hour and 5.77 per bus). Library Square has 56 boardings, 105 minutes, and 7 buses (32.00 per observed hour and 8.00 per bus).\n"},{"name":"index.html","bytes":24871,"sha256":"a5c3c66826e515f22b98d551f2b10499439025609f25c402cab3d1b6129243e0","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Bus Stop Counts</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light;\n    --paper: #f5f4ee;\n    --surface: #fffefa;\n    --ink: #182923;\n    --muted: #505d55;\n    --line: #dcded4;\n    --green: #205849;\n    --library: #a84d27;\n    --maple-tint: #e3efe7;\n    --library-tint: #f7e9df;\n    --error: #912b24;\n    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.5; }\n  h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }\n  button, input, select { font: inherit; color: inherit; }\n  button { cursor: pointer; }\n  button:disabled { cursor: default; opacity: .55; }\n  :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #715717; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  .wrap { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 64px)); margin-inline: auto; }\n  header { background: #163e34; color: #fffefa; overflow: hidden; }\n  .masthead { position: relative; isolation: isolate; padding-block: 34px 36px; }\n  h1 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.9rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.065em; margin-block: 10px 13px; }\n  .masthead p { color: #e3ece4; }\n  .route {\n    position: absolute; z-index: -1; right: 2%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 31%;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 24px, #a5c5b11c 24px 25px),\n                repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 24px, #a5c5b11c 24px 25px);\n    mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, black 25%, black 90%, transparent);\n  }\n  .route::before, .route::after {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 12%; right: 12%; top: 52%; height: 4px; background: #d6e88a;\n  }\n  .route::after { transform: rotate(-26deg); background: #eca279; }\n  .route span { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: calc(52% - 8px); width: 20px; height: 20px; border: 4px solid #d6e88a; border-radius: 50%; background: #163e34; }\n  .route span:first-child { left: 12%; }\n  .route span:last-child { right: 12%; }\n  main { padding-block: 24px 36px; }\n  .panel, .filters { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; }\n  h2 { font-size: 1.33rem; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.035em; }\n  h3 { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.3; }\n  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: .875rem; }\n  .filters { padding: 14px 20px; display: flex; gap: 12px 18px; align-items: end; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .filter-title { margin-right: auto; align-self: center; }\n  .filter-title h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 3px; }\n  .date-controls, .filter-options { display: flex; gap: 8px 12px; align-items: end; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  label { display: grid; gap: 5px; font-weight: 650; font-size: .83rem; }\n  input:not([type=checkbox]), select, .button {\n    min-height: 44px; border: 1px solid #aeb8ad; border-radius: 7px; padding: 7px 11px; background: var(--surface);\n  }\n  input:not([type=checkbox]), select { width: 100%; min-width: 0; background: #fff; font-size: 1rem; }\n  .date-controls input { min-inline-size: 9.5rem; }\n  .check { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; min-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .check input { width: 17px; height: 17px; margin: 0; accent-color: var(--green); }\n  .button { font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .button:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #ebefe7; }\n  .button.primary { background: var(--green); color: white; border-color: var(--green); }\n  .button.primary:hover { background: #163e34; }\n  .dashboard { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.1fr) minmax(292px, 1fr); gap: 20px; align-items: start; margin-block: 20px; }\n  .comparison, .entry { padding: 22px; }\n  .section-intro { margin-top: 7px; }\n  .metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-block: 17px; }\n  .metric { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px; }\n  .metric .muted { font-size: .79rem; margin-top: 3px; }\n  .metric-row { margin-top: 12px; }\n  .metric-label { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 5px; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 650; }\n  .rate { font-size: 1.48rem; font-weight: 740; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1.2; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .rate.unavailable { font-size: .77rem; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }\n  .track { background: #eeeee7; height: 7px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .bar { height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: var(--stop-color); }\n  .maple { --stop-color: var(--green); --stop-tint: var(--maple-tint); }\n  .library { --stop-color: var(--library); --stop-tint: var(--library-tint); }\n  .totals { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }\n  .total { background: var(--stop-tint); border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 12px; }\n  .total h3 { font-size: .83rem; }\n  .total p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .79rem; margin-top: 3px; }\n  .dot::before { content: \"\"; width: .62em; height: .62em; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; background: var(--stop-color); margin-inline-end: .42em; vertical-align: .06em; }\n  .entry form { display: grid; gap: 11px; margin-top: 17px; }\n  .entry-fields, .entry-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }\n  .entry-actions { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr)); }\n  .entry .section-intro { min-height: 2.65em; }\n  .error { color: var(--error); font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 650; }\n  .log-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding: 17px 22px; }\n  .log-header .muted { margin-top: 5px; }\n  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: .88rem; }\n  thead { background: #eeefe7; text-align: left; }\n  th { font-weight: 700; }\n  td, th { padding: 9px 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  td:first-child, th:first-child { padding-left: 22px; }\n  td:last-child, th:last-child { padding-right: 22px; }\n  td:nth-child(n+3), th:nth-child(n+3) { text-align: right; }\n  tbody tr:last-child td:first-child { border-radius: 0 0 0 14px; }\n  tbody tr:last-child td:last-child { border-radius: 0 0 14px 0; }\n  .sample { display: inline-block; border-radius: 4px; background: #eeefe7; color: var(--muted); padding: 1px 6px; font-size: .75rem; margin-inline-start: 5px; }\n  .na { color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .edit { padding: 0 6px; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; font-size: .84rem; text-decoration: underline; color: var(--green); background: none; border: 0; }\n  .edit:hover { background: #ebefe7; }\n  .empty { padding: 18px 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .notes { margin-top: 15px; }\n  .status { margin-top: 12px; }\n  .status:empty { display: none; }\n  @media (max-width: 940px) {\n    .route { opacity: .55; }\n    .dashboard { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(280px, 1fr); }\n    .comparison, .entry { padding: 17px; }\n    .metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .metric { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0 12px; }\n    .metric h3, .metric > p { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n  }\n  @media (701px <= width <= 940px) {\n    .entry-fields:first-child { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) {\n    .wrap { width: calc(100% - 32px); }\n    .dashboard { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .route { display: none; }\n    .filters { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; padding: 14px; }\n    .filter-title { align-self: start; }\n    .date-controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); width: 100%; }\n    .date-controls input { min-inline-size: 0; }\n    table { font-size: .83rem; }\n    td, th { padding: 8px 5px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n    td:first-child, th:first-child { padding-left: 9px; }\n    td:last-child, th:last-child { padding-right: 9px; }\n    .sample { margin-inline-start: 0; }\n    .na { white-space: normal; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 365px) {\n    .metric, .totals, .entry-fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .metric h3, .metric > p { grid-column: auto; }\n  }\n  @media print {\n    body { background: white; }\n    .wrap { width: 100%; }\n    header { background: white; color: black; }\n    .masthead { padding-block: 0 12px; }\n    .masthead p { color: black; }\n    .route, .entry, .date-controls, .filter-options, .button, .edit-column, .status { display: none !important; }\n    .dashboard { display: block; }\n    main { padding: 0; }\n    .comparison { break-inside: avoid; }\n    tr { break-inside: avoid; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap masthead\">\n      <h1>Bus Stop Counts</h1>\n    <p>Compare manual boarding counts at Maple Corner and Library Square.</p>\n    <div class=\"route\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n  <noscript><p class=\"error\">Enable JavaScript in your browser to use this offline tool.</p></noscript>\n  <section class=\"filters\" aria-labelledby=\"filter-title\">\n    <div class=\"filter-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"filter-title\">Observation dates</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\" id=\"range-summary\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"date-controls\">\n      <label for=\"from\">From <input type=\"date\" id=\"from\" aria-describedby=\"range-error\"></label>\n      <label for=\"through\">Through <input type=\"date\" id=\"through\" aria-describedby=\"range-error\"></label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"filter-options\">\n      <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"include-samples\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Include fictional samples</label>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"button\" id=\"clear-dates\">Clear dates</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"error\" id=\"range-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"dashboard\">\n    <section class=\"panel comparison\" aria-labelledby=\"comparison-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"comparison-title\">Stop comparison</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted section-intro\">Rates use the combined totals for each stop in the current view.</p>\n      <div class=\"metrics\" id=\"metrics\"></div>\n      <div class=\"totals\" id=\"totals\" aria-label=\"Pooled totals by stop\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"panel entry\" aria-labelledby=\"entry-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"entry-title\">Add a session</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted section-intro\" id=\"entry-help\">Enter one observation period at one stop. All fields are required.</p>\n      <form id=\"session-form\" aria-describedby=\"entry-help\">\n        <div class=\"entry-fields\">\n          <label for=\"date\">Date <input type=\"date\" id=\"date\" required></label>\n          <label for=\"stop\">Stop\n            <select id=\"stop\" required>\n              <option value=\"maple\">Maple Corner</option>\n              <option value=\"library\">Library Square</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <label for=\"minutes\">Minutes observed <input type=\"number\" id=\"minutes\" min=\"0.01\" step=\"0.01\" required inputmode=\"decimal\"></label>\n        <div class=\"entry-fields\">\n          <label for=\"boardings\">Boardings <input type=\"number\" id=\"boardings\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" required inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-describedby=\"entry-error\"></label>\n          <label for=\"buses\">Buses <input type=\"number\" id=\"buses\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" required inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-describedby=\"entry-error\"></label>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"error\" id=\"entry-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n        <div class=\"entry-actions\">\n          <button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\" id=\"save-session\">Save session</button>\n          <button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" id=\"cancel-edit\" hidden>Cancel edit</button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n      <p class=\"status muted\" id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"log-title\">\n    <div class=\"log-header\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"log-title\">Observation log</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\" id=\"log-summary\"></p>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"button\" id=\"export\">Export visible CSV</button>\n    </div>\n    <table id=\"log\" aria-labelledby=\"log-title\">\n      <thead><tr>\n        <th scope=\"col\">Date</th><th scope=\"col\">Stop</th><th scope=\"col\">Minutes</th>\n        <th scope=\"col\">Boardings</th><th scope=\"col\">Buses</th><th scope=\"col\">Per bus</th>\n        <th scope=\"col\" class=\"edit-column\" id=\"edit-column\" hidden>Edit</th>\n      </tr></thead>\n      <tbody id=\"rows\"></tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"empty muted\" id=\"empty\" hidden></p>\n  </section>\n  <p class=\"muted notes\" id=\"storage-note\">Entries are saved in this browser. Export the visible sessions to keep a copy.</p>\n</main>\n<script>\n\"use strict\";\n\nconst stops = [\n  { id: \"maple\", name: \"Maple Corner\" },\n  { id: \"library\", name: \"Library Square\" }\n];\nconst stopNames = Object.fromEntries(stops.map(({ id, name }) => [id, name]));\nconst samples = [\n  [\"2026-06-01\", \"maple\", 30, 18, 3],\n  [\"2026-06-01\", \"library\", 45, 36, 4],\n  [\"2026-06-03\", \"maple\", 45, 24, 4],\n  [\"2026-06-03\", \"library\", 30, 20, 3],\n  [\"2026-06-08\", \"maple\", 60, 33, 6],\n  [\"2026-06-08\", \"library\", 30, 0, 0]\n].map(([date, stop, minutes, boardings, buses]) => ({ date, stop, minutes, boardings, buses, sample: true }));\n\nconst prefix = \"bus-stop-counts.session.v1.\";\nconst entries = new Map();\nconst unsaved = new Set();\nconst number = new Intl.NumberFormat(\"en-US\", { maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\nconst rate = new Intl.NumberFormat(\"en-US\", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\nconst dateFormat = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(\"en-US\", { dateStyle: \"medium\", timeZone: \"UTC\" });\nconst $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\nconst fields = [\"date\", \"stop\", \"minutes\", \"boardings\", \"buses\"];\nlet displayed = [];\nlet editing = null;\n\nfunction formatDate(date) {\n  return dateFormat.format(new Date(date + \"T00:00:00Z\"));\n}\n\nfunction validDate(date) {\n  if (typeof date !== \"string\" || !/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(date) || date.startsWith(\"0000\")) return false;\n  const parsed = new Date(date + \"T00:00:00Z\");\n  return Number.isFinite(+parsed) && parsed.toISOString().slice(0, 10) === date;\n}\n\nfunction validSession(session) {\n  return session && validDate(session.date) && Object.hasOwn(stopNames, session.stop)\n    && Number.isFinite(session.minutes) && session.minutes >= 0.01 && session.minutes <= Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER\n    && Number.isSafeInteger(session.boardings) && session.boardings >= 0\n    && Number.isSafeInteger(session.buses) && session.buses >= 0\n    && (session.buses > 0 || session.boardings === 0);\n}\n\nfunction storageWarning() {\n  $(\"storage-note\").textContent = \"Browser storage is unavailable for some entries. Export the visible sessions before closing the page.\";\n}\n\nfunction loadEntries() {\n  try {\n    const stored = new Map();\n    for (let index = 0; index < localStorage.length; index += 1) {\n      const key = localStorage.key(index);\n      if (!key?.startsWith(prefix) || unsaved.has(key)) continue;\n      try {\n        const session = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key));\n        if (!validSession(session)) continue;\n        const { date, stop, minutes, boardings, buses } = session;\n        stored.set(key, { date, stop, minutes, boardings, buses, key });\n      } catch (error) {\n        if (!(error instanceof SyntaxError)) throw error;\n      }\n    }\n    for (const key of entries.keys()) {\n      if (!stored.has(key) && !unsaved.has(key)) entries.delete(key);\n    }\n    for (const [key, session] of stored) entries.set(key, session);\n  } catch {\n    storageWarning();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction pool(sessions, stop) {\n  const total = { sessions: 0, minutes: 0, boardings: 0, buses: 0 };\n  for (const session of sessions) {\n    if (session.stop !== stop) continue;\n    total.sessions += 1;\n    total.minutes += session.minutes;\n    total.boardings += session.boardings;\n    total.buses += session.buses;\n  }\n  return total;\n}\n\nfunction renderComparison(totals) {\n  const measures = [\n    { label: \"Boardings per observed hour\", formula: \"Boardings ÷ (minutes observed ÷ 60)\", divisor: \"minutes\", multiplier: 60 },\n    { label: \"Boardings per bus\", formula: \"Boardings ÷ buses observed\", divisor: \"buses\", multiplier: 1 }\n  ];\n  $(\"metrics\").innerHTML = measures.map(({ label, formula, divisor, multiplier }) => {\n    const values = totals.map((total) => total[divisor] ? total.boardings / total[divisor] * multiplier : null);\n    const max = Math.max(...values, 0);\n    const rows = stops.map(({ id, name }, index) => {\n      const value = values[index];\n      const reason = totals[index].sessions ? \"No buses\" : \"No sessions\";\n      const formatted = value === null ? reason : rate.format(value);\n      const width = max && value !== null ? value / max * 100 : 0;\n      return `<div class=\"metric-row ${id}\">\n        <div class=\"metric-label\"><span class=\"dot\">${name}</span>\n        <span class=\"rate ${value === null ? \"unavailable\" : \"\"}\">${formatted}</span></div>\n        <div class=\"track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"${value === null ? \" hidden\" : \"\"}><div class=\"bar\" style=\"width:${width}%\"></div></div>\n      </div>`;\n    }).join(\"\");\n    return `<article class=\"metric\"><h3>${label}</h3><p class=\"muted\">${formula}</p>${rows}</article>`;\n  }).join(\"\");\n\n  $(\"totals\").innerHTML = stops.map(({ id, name }, index) => {\n    const { sessions, minutes, boardings, buses } = totals[index];\n    const label = sessions === 1 ? \"session\" : \"sessions\";\n    return `<article class=\"total ${id}\"><h3 class=\"dot\">${name} totals</h3>\n      <p>${number.format(sessions)} ${label} · ${number.format(minutes)} min · ${number.format(boardings)} boardings · ${number.format(buses)} ${buses === 1 ? \"bus\" : \"buses\"}</p></article>`;\n  }).join(\"\");\n}\n\nfunction renderLog(invalidRange) {\n  const hasEdits = displayed.some((session) => !session.sample);\n  $(\"edit-column\").hidden = !hasEdits;\n  $(\"export\").disabled = displayed.length === 0;\n  $(\"log\").hidden = displayed.length === 0;\n  $(\"empty\").hidden = displayed.length > 0;\n  $(\"empty\").textContent = invalidRange ? \"Correct the date range to view sessions.\" : \"No sessions match this view. Clear the dates, include the samples, or add an observation.\";\n  const sampleCount = displayed.filter((session) => session.sample).length;\n  $(\"log-summary\").textContent = `${number.format(displayed.length)} ${displayed.length === 1 ? \"session\" : \"sessions\"} shown · ${number.format(sampleCount)} fictional`;\n\n  $(\"rows\").replaceChildren(...displayed.map((session) => {\n    const row = document.createElement(\"tr\");\n    const { date, stop, minutes, boardings, buses, sample, key } = session;\n    for (const text of [formatDate(date), stopNames[stop], number.format(minutes), number.format(boardings), number.format(buses), buses ? rate.format(boardings / buses) : \"— No buses\"]) {\n      row.insertCell().textContent = text;\n    }\n    row.cells[1].className = `dot ${stop}`;\n    if (!buses) row.cells[5].className = \"na\";\n    if (sample) {\n      const badge = document.createElement(\"span\");\n      badge.className = \"sample\";\n      badge.textContent = \"Sample\";\n      row.cells[1].append(\" \", badge);\n    }\n    if (hasEdits) {\n      const cell = row.insertCell();\n      cell.className = \"edit-column\";\n      if (!sample) {\n        const button = document.createElement(\"button\");\n        button.type = \"button\";\n        button.className = \"edit\";\n        button.textContent = \"Edit\";\n        button.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", `Edit ${stopNames[stop]} session on ${formatDate(date)}`);\n        button.dataset.key = key;\n        cell.append(button);\n      }\n    }\n    return row;\n  }));\n}\n\nfunction render() {\n  const from = $(\"from\").value;\n  const through = $(\"through\").value;\n  const invalidDate = [\"from\", \"through\"].some((id) => {\n    const input = $(id);\n    return input.validity.badInput || (input.value && !validDate(input.value));\n  });\n  const reversed = Boolean(from && through && from > through);\n  const invalidRange = invalidDate || reversed;\n  $(\"range-error\").hidden = !invalidRange;\n  $(\"range-error\").textContent = invalidDate ? \"Enter complete dates with a four-digit year.\"\n    : reversed ? \"The through date must be on or after the from date.\" : \"\";\n  $(\"clear-dates\").disabled = !(from || through || invalidDate);\n  $(\"range-summary\").textContent = invalidRange ? \"Date range needs correction\"\n    : from && through ? `${formatDate(from)} – ${formatDate(through)}`\n      : from ? `From ${formatDate(from)} onward`\n        : through ? `Through ${formatDate(through)}` : \"All dates\";\n\n  const dataset = $(\"include-samples\").checked ? [...samples, ...entries.values()] : [...entries.values()];\n  displayed = invalidRange ? [] : dataset.filter(({ date }) => (!from || date >= from) && (!through || date <= through))\n    .sort((a, b) => a.date.localeCompare(b.date));\n  renderComparison(stops.map(({ id }) => pool(displayed, id)));\n  renderLog(invalidRange);\n}\n\nfunction entryError(message) {\n  $(\"entry-error\").textContent = message;\n  $(\"entry-error\").hidden = !message;\n}\n\nfunction finishEditing() {\n  editing = null;\n  $(\"entry-title\").textContent = \"Add a session\";\n  $(\"save-session\").textContent = \"Save session\";\n  $(\"cancel-edit\").hidden = true;\n  $(\"session-form\").reset();\n  entryError(\"\");\n}\n\nfunction focusEditButton(key) {\n  const button = [...$(\"rows\").querySelectorAll(\"button[data-key]\")].find((item) => item.dataset.key === key);\n  (button || $(\"date\")).focus();\n}\n\n$(\"session-form\").addEventListener(\"submit\", (event) => {\n  event.preventDefault();\n  entryError(\"\");\n  $(\"status\").textContent = \"\";\n  const session = { date: $(\"date\").value, stop: $(\"stop\").value, minutes: $(\"minutes\").valueAsNumber,\n    boardings: $(\"boardings\").valueAsNumber, buses: $(\"buses\").valueAsNumber };\n\n  if (!validSession(session)) {\n    const impossible = session.buses === 0 && session.boardings > 0;\n    entryError(impossible ? \"Enter zero boardings when zero buses were observed.\"\n      : \"Enter a four-digit year, positive minutes, and nonnegative whole counts.\");\n    if (impossible) $(\"boardings\").focus();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const wasEditing = editing !== null;\n  const key = editing || prefix + (globalThis.crypto?.randomUUID?.() || Date.now() + \"-\" + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2));\n  let saved = true;\n  try {\n    localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(session));\n    unsaved.delete(key);\n  } catch {\n    unsaved.add(key);\n    storageWarning();\n    saved = false;\n  }\n  entries.set(key, { ...session, key });\n  finishEditing();\n  if (!wasEditing) {\n    $(\"date\").value = session.date;\n    $(\"stop\").value = session.stop;\n  }\n  render();\n  const message = saved ? (wasEditing ? \"Session updated.\" : \"Session saved.\") : \"Session kept for this visit only.\";\n  $(\"status\").textContent = displayed.some((row) => row.key === key)\n    ? message : message + \" Clear or adjust the dates to see it.\";\n  if (wasEditing) focusEditButton(key);\n  else $(\"minutes\").focus();\n});\n\n$(\"rows\").addEventListener(\"click\", (event) => {\n  const button = event.target.closest(\"button[data-key]\");\n  if (!button) return;\n  const session = entries.get(button.dataset.key);\n  if (!session) return;\n  editing = session.key;\n  for (const id of fields) $(id).value = session[id];\n  $(\"entry-title\").textContent = \"Edit session\";\n  $(\"save-session\").textContent = \"Save changes\";\n  $(\"cancel-edit\").hidden = false;\n  $(\"status\").textContent = \"\";\n  entryError(\"\");\n  $(\"date\").focus();\n});\n\n$(\"cancel-edit\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  const key = editing;\n  finishEditing();\n  focusEditButton(key);\n});\n\nfor (const id of [\"from\", \"through\", \"include-samples\"]) $(id).addEventListener(\"change\", render);\n$(\"clear-dates\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  $(\"from\").value = \"\";\n  $(\"through\").value = \"\";\n  render();\n  $(\"from\").focus();\n});\n\n$(\"export\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  const header = \"date,stop,minutes observed,boardings,buses,source\";\n  const lines = displayed.map(({ date, stop, minutes, boardings, buses, sample }) => {\n    return [date, stopNames[stop], minutes, boardings, buses, sample ? \"fictional sample\" : \"manual entry\"].join(\",\");\n  });\n  const url = URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([[header, ...lines].join(\"\\r\\n\") + \"\\r\\n\"], { type: \"text/csv;charset=utf-8\" }));\n  const link = document.createElement(\"a\");\n  link.href = url;\n  link.download = \"bus-stop-counts.csv\";\n  document.body.append(link);\n  link.click();\n  link.remove();\n  setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);\n});\n\nwindow.addEventListener(\"storage\", (event) => {\n  if (event.key === null || event.key.startsWith(prefix)) {\n    loadEntries();\n    render();\n  }\n});\n\nloadEntries();\nrender();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/9112f4c13f9a3e7237b2a6f94c737d9e766a58652c7c03cbee7ae7ba80077976.zip"}}}
